      en: ["The massacre lasted for several weeks.", "The exact number of victims is still disputed today.", "February 3rd is a national holiday.", "The incident was covered up by the colonial power for a long time.", "The memorial was erected after independence.", "It serves as a warning against oppression and colonialism.", "Survivors and their descendants participate in the ceremonies."]
